    rdf:value """Saturday, May 13, 1916, Caprarola
Arrived here to tea and found Thryphosa Bates Batcheller and her husband, who have been here for a week. He sang and praised her own voice and talked about the Infanta Eulalia. Reach a goose.
This was May 17.
May 12-17 
[124-129 blank pages]"""^^xsd:string ;
